{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n>"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もコメントくださったかた！\n非常に有り難うございます(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近頑張っていることは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"っの！質問にもこたえてくださって★       ありがたい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後までblog読んでいただけたんだなぁ？\nっと思うと...もう、ニヤニヤ全快！\nむしろゲラゲラ笑ってるぜ〜☆ワイルドだろぉ？＼(^^)／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんか、昔のblogのコメントも増えててびっくりなんだけどー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー(^-^ゞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハイハイ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏休みに入って、一日中食べ物を食べつくしている和田です(^-^ゞ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（広島のおばあちゃんから\nまあやがフルーツ好きだから！って\n送ってきてくれたの〜ありがとう♪）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だめだだめだ〜(-。-)y-~"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"やらなきゃいけないことがあるだろ〜......。そうだよ！これだよこれー★☆★"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁー大量にあるんだよー(^o^;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今のところ、社会と理科を終わらせたぜっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"えらいだろっ(・・;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あとは！嫌いな数学も英語もある！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！\nぬおぉぉぉぉぉぉ(-_-)/~~~(;´д｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ていせいする！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"英語は、\nもぅ\nもちのろんで、\nもちろん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"得意中のとくいだゼゼゼゼーイッ(汗汗汗)\nあぁそうだよ！とくいだよ！汗汗汗汗汗"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あぁーまぁもぉこの話はまーいーやーん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隣で寝てるのはひめたんよぉー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寝顔だから、これのっけていいー？\nって聞いたら\nええよー！ゆうてくれたー\nうれぴー(^-^)/\nひめたんは広島出身で一緒なんだー＼(^o^)／\nオーディションのときから仲良しなんのだ〜っ(^-^)/\nすきよー！だいすきー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あっ！好きと言えばゆったん！\nゆったんすき！\nゆったんといえばー誕生日！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沢山プレゼントもらったかな？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも、明るくて、しょっちゅう人のお尻とか触ってるゆったんが大好きっ！これからもよろしくっ(^-^)v"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てかね、今電車に乗っててねぇ、まぁやが\nおばぁちゃんに席を譲ったらね、当たり前のことなのにねぇ、\nニコニコしながら(o^−^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとー★"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"って言ってくれたー\n照れるけど嬉しいねぇ★エヘヘ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんでまたいいことがあった☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"階段を登ってるおばちゃんが、荷物おもそうだったのー\nそしたら、男の人が、もってあげてて、素敵だったー☆★☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心がホッコリしたよー(o^−^o)\nこんな世界にしていきたいですねぇー(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あのね...\n時々、寂しくなった時は\nコメント読んだり...握手会の時の皆の顔を思い出したり...\nお部屋の皆様から頂いたコーナーでホッコリしたりしてます\n本当にまあやパワーの充電だよ〜\n本当にありがとうです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/maaya.wada/img/files/46/_pre/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/22/6849025/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"しつもーんっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あらっちゃりーやぁ\nとは、広島弁なんですが、標準語だとなんでしょう？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほんで、今回のタイトルは、コメントでいちばんさいしょに考えてくださった方のタイトルを採用させていただきやした(^^)d\nありがとう"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、せーのっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バーーーーイッ"}],"source":"archive"}